		{"id":"b1c1069ccc204bb0","type":"group","x":2020,"y":-580,"width":800,"height":980,"label":"C2 Web Interface"},
		{"id":"ff72d499241fd1df","type":"text","text":"# TCP Socket Handler\n\n*Needed*\n- Starts a new thread for each connection\n- Every connection is treated like the same device \n\t- This is to handle situations where the UAV disconnects and reconnects\n\t- There should only ever be one UAV\n- Command Callback function\n- Send Command function\n- One static socket\n\t- This is overridden when a new connection is received\n\t\t- This way the application is always working with the current connection\n\n*Methods*\n- socket_handler_init(receive_message_callback_function)\n\t- Starts up a new thread\n- socket_handler_send(String)\n\n*Variables*\n- static : socket","x":-120,"y":-180,"width":640,"height":600,"color":"6"},
